Bundled in the package
----------------------
  Archivo        the font (app/src/fonts/). Copyright 2020 The Archivo Project Authors
                 (https://github.com/Omnibus-Type/Archivo). SIL Open Font License 1.1: app/src/fonts/OFL.txt.

needle-engine is built with the Rust crates that engine/Cargo.lock pins, linked into the binary. Their
licenses:
  librespot      MIT (https://github.com/librespot-org/librespot)
  most others    MIT, Apache-2.0, or either; a few BSD, Zlib, Unicode-3.0 or Unlicense
  MPL-2.0        mpris-server, symphonia and priority-queue (the last two via librespot). needle uses them
                 unmodified; their source is on crates.io at the versions in engine/Cargo.lock.

`cargo tree --manifest-path engine/Cargo.toml` lists every crate; each one's license is in its Cargo.toml.


